wa-web is a static recompilation project for Worms Armageddon. It is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Team17.

LICENSE covers the handwritten files in this repository: configuration
(game.toml, globals.toml), scripts under tools/, CI and documentation.

Worms Armageddon, its executable code, artwork, audio, levels and other data
belong to their owners and are never included here. Every player and
contributor supplies their own legally owned copy (GOG.com v3.8.1). Ghidra
listings and translated C generated from WA.exe are local build products and
are never tracked.

kit/ is a git submodule of recomp-kit (https://github.com/veritr1x/recomp-kit,
used through the fork https://github.com/dogukanduran/recomp-kit). It carries
its own LICENSE and NOTICE, which cover its code and bundled third-party
components.
